WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
Welcome to Xryon — your AI assistant for chat, images, code and voice.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.150
Here's a quick tour of everything you can do.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.750
Type any question into the message box and press Enter.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.350
Xryon answers in seconds — ask follow-ups to keep going.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.950
Type a slash at the start of your message to see shortcut commands.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.550
Try /new for a fresh chat, or /research for deeper answers.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.150
To create a picture, just describe what you want to see.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.750
Open the Images page any time to find everything you've made.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.350
Tap the plus button to turn on web search for live, up-to-date answers.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.950
Rich cards show lists and reports in a clean, easy-to-read layout.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.550
Open Codex to build websites, apps and scripts by describing them.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.150
Preview your project, fix errors and host it when you're ready.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.750
Tap the voice button to talk to Xryon out loud.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.350
It listens, thinks and answers — hands-free.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.950
In Settings, switch to the white theme with one tap.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.550
You can also link a trusted account and switch between the two instantly.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.150
Open Help and Support any time to read guides or contact the team.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.750
Thanks for using Xryon — enjoy!
